# Decision X12 (report 028): Settings > Battery on a board with a power_supply battery (the harness's fake tree, command
# "battery": the tablet's BAT1 and ADP1). The root menu gets Battery after Bluetooth; its page reads the battery every
# 2 s: discharging (time left, power), charging (time to full), full, then the battery gone while the page is open.
# A release build, the tablet's board profile and density at 1280x800. Review only: no golden.
title settings battery
review
sizes 320x170 480x320 640x480 1280x800
@1280x800 ppmm 842
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
@1280x800 env APPLAUNCH_BOARD pc-fzm1-2
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
battery 85 discharging
home
launch Settings
wait 300
expect_rows Screen Wi-Fi Bluetooth Battery Launcher Touch Apps Updates User "Date & Time" System
shot settings_battery_root
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_text "3 h 27 min"
expect_text "6.5 W"
shot settings_battery_page
battery 42 charging
wait 2100
expect_text "1 h 17 min"
shot settings_battery_charging
battery 100 full
wait 2100
expect_text Full
shot settings_battery_full
battery off
wait 2100
expect_text "No battery"
shot settings_battery_gone
key ESC
wait 300
shot settings_battery_back
